OL,3,GNEWSACharity expects demand for
OL,4,AChristmas present campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shropshire charity has said it
OL,7,Fexpects demand to be high this year for
OL,8,Fits campaign which provides Christmas
OL,9,Fpresents to struggling families.
OL,11,FLittle Stars, which gives away free
OL,12,Fessentials to families in need, has
OL,13,Flaunched Santa's Little Stars, which
OL,14,Fruns from Saturday 24 October to Friday
OL,15,F4 December.
OL,17,FThe public is asked to donate new,
OL,18,Funwrapped toys and gifts to donation
OL,19,Fpoints in Shrewsbury's Darwin shopping
OL,20,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
